        Bootstrapped B2B startups can achieve full SOC 2 Type II compliance under $20,000 by pairing boutique independent CPA firms with native cloud security primitives. Replacing expensive enterprise automation suites with GitHub Actions, AWS GuardDuty, Google Workspace MDM, and open-source policy frameworks reduces compliance tooling costs to nearly zero without sacrificing audit integrity.
      </p>
