            <td class="p-3.5 text-emerald-400 font-mono">Osquery + FleetDM Core</td>
            <td class="p-3.5 text-cyan-300 font-mono">Kandji / Jamf Pro ($6k+)</td>
            <td class="p-3.5 font-mono">Saves $6,000 / yr</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-white font-sans">Kubernetes Runtime Intrusion Alert</td>
            <td class="p-3.5 text-emerald-400 font-mono">Falco eBPF Kernel Rules</td>
